{"transcription": [{"offsets": {"from": 1000, "to": 9000}, "text": " Hi, I just wanted to do a video taking a look at how you level audio in video editing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 9000, "to": 12000}, "text": " And, well, not just for video editing, but for podcasts as well."}, {"offsets": {"from": 12000, "to": 17000}, "text": " If you don't know, I do the podcast The Amp Hour. I've been doing that with Chris Gammel from day one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 17000, "to": 24000}, "text": " And we use a program called The Levelator. Here it is."}, {"offsets": {"from": 24000, "to": 29000}, "text": " From a company called The Conversations Network, but it's long since been abandoned."}, {"offsets": {"from": 29000, "to": 36000}, "text": " But it still works. And what the idea with this is, is that you, once you've finished your podcast, for example,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 36000, "to": 41000}, "text": " you would put it through this magic Levelator program which levels all your audio."}, {"offsets": {"from": 41000, "to": 50000}, "text": " Because if you've got, when you're recording a podcast, or in this case, I'm editing a video where both David and I were talking"}, {"offsets": {"from": 50000, "to": 58000}, "text": " and I'm louder, you know, typically loud, even though we're sort of the same distance from my microphone like this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 58000, "to": 64000}, "text": " I sort of put it in the middle, but because we're both, like, even though we're the same distance,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 64000, "to": 68000}, "text": " people naturally have different levels of their, you know, their speech."}, {"offsets": {"from": 68000, "to": 73000}, "text": " Some people are louder than others. I'm typically louder than David, as we'll see in here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 73000, "to": 76000}, "text": " And it just, and sometimes you'll speak quieter like this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 76000, "to": 82000}, "text": " And there's lots of variants, unless you're doing voiceover work like I will often do in my videos here,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 82000, "to": 87000}, "text": " or I'm doing screen capture, I'm typically a fixed distance from the microphone like this,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 87000, "to": 91000}, "text": " and, or when I'm behind the camera, for example, I've got an external microphone,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 91000, "to": 95000}, "text": " and I'm typically, you know, a reasonable fixed distance from the microphone."}, {"offsets": {"from": 95000, "to": 101000}, "text": " And when I'm recording video just myself, or I'm recording a podcast, I'm the same distance from the mic."}, {"offsets": {"from": 101000, "to": 103000}, "text": " So there's not much variation in my voice."}, {"offsets": {"from": 103000, "to": 108000}, "text": " So I typically don't have to do, when I'm editing my videos, I don't have to level out the audio."}, {"offsets": {"from": 108000, "to": 113000}, "text": " But occasionally, when you shoot multiple people in a podcast, in this case,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 113000, "to": 117000}, "text": " when you've got, or you've got someone speaking louder than another person, all these great variants,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 117000, "to": 119000}, "text": " you know, you're moving forward and back from the mic."}, {"offsets": {"from": 119000, "to": 123000}, "text": " Like if I go back like here, you know, you'll notice the difference in the level,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 123000, "to": 130000}, "text": " because I'm not going to level this video, ironically, because, well, that would be beside the point, as we'll see."}, {"offsets": {"from": 130000, "to": 135000}, "text": " And, but often, well, sometimes you do have to level your audio."}, {"offsets": {"from": 135000, "to": 138000}, "text": " And we've always used this program called the Levelator, as I said,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 138000, "to": 143000}, "text": " and it's, it really is quite magical, and you just drop in, you export,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 143000, "to": 150000}, "text": " what you do is you go up to, I use Vegas here, which is Magix Vegas, it's no longer Sony Vegas,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 150000, "to": 159000}, "text": " and you just render as, and you render as an AIFF audio interface, which is a lossless audio thing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 159000, "to": 165000}, "text": " So once you've finished editing your, once you've finished editing your project like this,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 165000, "to": 170000}, "text": " this is an hour-long video, and so you export, you export it just as an audio track,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 170000, "to": 176000}, "text": " you drop it into this magic Levelator program, and it, and it just magically,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 176000, "to": 182000}, "text": " like it's, first of all it does a pass through the audio, and it finds like the low peaks,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 182000, "to": 186000}, "text": " and like it finds like the noise level, and it kind of tries to reduce noise,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 186000, "to": 190000}, "text": " and then it finds all the different peaks and troughs in the, in the audio,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 190000, "to": 196000}, "text": " and then it tries to level it all out, so that when, like a soft speaker will be the same volume"}, {"offsets": {"from": 196000, "to": 202000}, "text": " in the end result as, you know, a louder person like this, and it'll just level everything out."}, {"offsets": {"from": 202000, "to": 206000}, "text": " But it can amplify noise and other stuff, so on really, like on noisy,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 206000, "to": 210000}, "text": " if you're recording in a noisy environment, for example, can be really, you know,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 210000, "to": 215000}, "text": " it doesn't work that great. Anyway, this program has actually been abandoned for many years now,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 215000, "to": 220000}, "text": " so I thought I would try a new, and this is what this video is about,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 220000, "to": 226000}, "text": " actually comparing this Orphonic, orphonic.com."}, {"offsets": {"from": 226000, "to": 230000}, "text": " It's, there is a free version of this software, it's mostly a paid thing,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 230000, "to": 235000}, "text": " but there is a free version, which I'm using now, which is a two-hour time limit,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 235000, "to": 238000}, "text": " so you can use two hours versus, put two hours of audio in here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 238000, "to": 244000}, "text": " So I put, just put one hour of audio in there, 58 minutes, and it's, you can also,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 244000, "to": 250000}, "text": " it does lots of other things, like great for podcasts, inserting, like intros and outros,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 250000, "to": 253000}, "text": " and stuff like that, and ad spots, and all sorts of, you know, other things,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 253000, "to": 256000}, "text": " but I just want to use it to level the audio out."}, {"offsets": {"from": 256000, "to": 261000}, "text": " And a lot of people will say, oh, you just normalize your audio inside Vegas."}, {"offsets": {"from": 261000, "to": 266000}, "text": " No, I'm sorry, it's not that easy. Let's actually go and take a look at,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 266000, "to": 269000}, "text": " so we'll look at comparing the two different ones in a minute."}, {"offsets": {"from": 270000, "to": 272000}, "text": " But, let's have a look here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 272000, "to": 277000}, "text": " Okay, this track here, okay, this one, oh, sorry."}, {"offsets": {"from": 279000, "to": 280000}, "text": " Let's go back here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 280000, "to": 283000}, "text": " Okay, this, I've got three different audio tracks here, right?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 283000, "to": 285000}, "text": " Normally I've only got the one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 285000, "to": 290000}, "text": " Okay, this is the audio direct from my microphone that we recorded this video from,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 290000, "to": 296000}, "text": " and you can see that it's quite low in volume, and it's like, like it's louder over here at this point."}, {"offsets": {"from": 296000, "to": 299000}, "text": " This is the waveform. You can see it's louder over here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 299000, "to": 302000}, "text": " Then it can get, you know, there's softer parts in here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 302000, "to": 304000}, "text": " This is probably David talking."}, {"offsets": {"from": 304000, "to": 306000}, "text": " And then just type a name."}, {"offsets": {"from": 306000, "to": 307000}, "text": " Dummy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 307000, "to": 309000}, "text": " There you go, I know you're in."}, {"offsets": {"from": 309000, "to": 312000}, "text": " Let's see if CMake, there you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 312000, "to": 313000}, "text": " All right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 313000, "to": 315000}, "text": " Just lots of pressing the same button."}, {"offsets": {"from": 315000, "to": 318000}, "text": " And I would see, someone like me, well, I would never have figured this out."}, {"offsets": {"from": 318000, "to": 322000}, "text": " Would anyone looking at your, all we have is this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 322000, "to": 324000}, "text": " Just lots of pressing the same button."}, {"offsets": {"from": 324000, "to": 328000}, "text": " And the audio there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 328000, "to": 330000}, "text": " Sorry, I'm looking away from the camera here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 330000, "to": 334000}, "text": " I'm filming this, I'm recording this on my 4K monitor, by the way."}, {"offsets": {"from": 334000, "to": 340000}, "text": " Anyway, so there's all this natural variance in the audio."}, {"offsets": {"from": 340000, "to": 343000}, "text": " So it's really not that great to listen to it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 343000, "to": 344000}, "text": " Like, it's okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 344000, "to": 346000}, "text": " Like, it sounds dynamic."}, {"offsets": {"from": 346000, "to": 351000}, "text": " Like, it sounds, because there's lots of variance in the audio."}, {"offsets": {"from": 351000, "to": 355000}, "text": " It sounds real, because there's all that variance."}, {"offsets": {"from": 355000, "to": 357000}, "text": " So your mind goes, oh yeah, that's just normal speech."}, {"offsets": {"from": 357000, "to": 359000}, "text": " Yeah, David's sitting further back or whatever."}, {"offsets": {"from": 359000, "to": 362000}, "text": " Your mind just thinks that's quite normal."}, {"offsets": {"from": 362000, "to": 364000}, "text": " But still, it's not that great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 364000, "to": 368000}, "text": " If you're listening through headphones or whatever,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 368000, "to": 371000}, "text": " it's just sometimes it can be really annoying."}, {"offsets": {"from": 371000, "to": 376000}, "text": " So really, this is a classic video of where I would normalize the audio."}, {"offsets": {"from": 376000, "to": 382000}, "text": " A lot of people say, oh, Dave, you can just normalize it inside Vegas."}, {"offsets": {"from": 382000, "to": 383000}, "text": " Well, let's go in."}, {"offsets": {"from": 383000, "to": 386000}, "text": " Let's try and normalize this, okay?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 386000, "to": 390000}, "text": " I can go in here, I can right-click, switches, and I can,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 390000, "to": 393000}, "text": " oh, it is normalized, what?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 393000, "to": 394000}, "text": " No, it shouldn't be."}, {"offsets": {"from": 394000, "to": 397000}, "text": " And I can just, oh, no, this is a bad example."}, {"offsets": {"from": 397000, "to": 400000}, "text": " Okay, no, let me find another example here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 400000, "to": 405000}, "text": " Let's go up to here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 405000, "to": 407000}, "text": " Sorry, hang on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 407000, "to": 410000}, "text": " Let's go this one here, okay?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 410000, "to": 415000}, "text": " Let's go this one here, which has David talking softly and me talking loudly, okay?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 415000, "to": 419000}, "text": " And you can do this across the whole track, but we'll just do it on the one clip."}, {"offsets": {"from": 419000, "to": 425000}, "text": " So if I go normalize, switches, normalize like this,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 426000, "to": 430000}, "text": " it has, yeah, it's expanded, it's amplified things, okay?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 430000, "to": 435000}, "text": " But it hasn't normalized the speech between the two."}, {"offsets": {"from": 435000, "to": 438000}, "text": " Yeah, it's made me louder, but it's made David correspondingly louder."}, {"offsets": {"from": 438000, "to": 443000}, "text": " All it does is chooses this peak part here, which would be right here,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 443000, "to": 445000}, "text": " and puts that, yeah, there's a setting."}, {"offsets": {"from": 445000, "to": 448000}, "text": " It puts that like 3 dB below the peak or whatever."}, {"offsets": {"from": 448000, "to": 449000}, "text": " You can change that setting."}, {"offsets": {"from": 449000, "to": 454000}, "text": " But it doesn't do anything intelligent to make this over here sound."}, {"offsets": {"from": 454000, "to": 455000}, "text": " There you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 455000, "to": 456000}, "text": " That's the dummy workspace."}, {"offsets": {"from": 456000, "to": 457000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 457000, "to": 458000}, "text": " It does have instructions on the Git."}, {"offsets": {"from": 458000, "to": 460000}, "text": " Oh, I was going to say, if you got hit by a bus."}, {"offsets": {"from": 460000, "to": 462000}, "text": " Find nothing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 462000, "to": 463000}, "text": " There you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 463000, "to": 464000}, "text": " That's the dummy workspace."}, {"offsets": {"from": 464000, "to": 468000}, "text": " It's not the same thing as what the Levelator program does"}, {"offsets": {"from": 468000, "to": 472000}, "text": " and what this Orphonic program will do."}, {"offsets": {"from": 472000, "to": 476000}, "text": " So what I've got here, let me just mute that entire track, okay?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 476000, "to": 478000}, "text": " So we won't get anything there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 478000, "to": 480000}, "text": " So we're going to be looking at your\u2026"}, {"offsets": {"from": 480000, "to": 481000}, "text": " Oh, hang on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 481000, "to": 483000}, "text": " No, I goofed it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 483000, "to": 484000}, "text": " Sorry."}, {"offsets": {"from": 484000, "to": 486000}, "text": " I completely goofed that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 486000, "to": 489000}, "text": " I didn't have both the other tracks muted."}, {"offsets": {"from": 489000, "to": 490000}, "text": " Sorry."}, {"offsets": {"from": 490000, "to": 491000}, "text": " Let's do this again."}, {"offsets": {"from": 491000, "to": 492000}, "text": " All right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 492000, "to": 493000}, "text": " I won't edit this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 493000, "to": 494000}, "text": " Okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 494000, "to": 496000}, "text": " So now we're going to type CMake."}, {"offsets": {"from": 496000, "to": 497000}, "text": " Here we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 497000, "to": 499000}, "text": " Save workspace as."}, {"offsets": {"from": 499000, "to": 500000}, "text": " And then just type a name."}, {"offsets": {"from": 500000, "to": 501000}, "text": " Talking softly."}, {"offsets": {"from": 501000, "to": 503000}, "text": " I was going to say, if you got hit by a bus."}, {"offsets": {"from": 503000, "to": 504000}, "text": " Me too."}, {"offsets": {"from": 504000, "to": 505000}, "text": " Much louder."}, {"offsets": {"from": 505000, "to": 506000}, "text": " So that's the natural difference."}, {"offsets": {"from": 506000, "to": 508000}, "text": " Looks like it's found a whole bunch of stuff."}, {"offsets": {"from": 508000, "to": 510000}, "text": " Oh, I was going to say, if you got hit by a bus."}, {"offsets": {"from": 510000, "to": 511000}, "text": " CMake."}, {"offsets": {"from": 511000, "to": 514000}, "text": " And save workspace as."}, {"offsets": {"from": 514000, "to": 515000}, "text": " Okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 515000, "to": 516000}, "text": " So I'll mute that now."}, {"offsets": {"from": 516000, "to": 518000}, "text": " And this is the result\u2026"}, {"offsets": {"from": 518000, "to": 519000}, "text": " Dummy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 519000, "to": 520000}, "text": " There you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 520000, "to": 521000}, "text": " There you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 521000, "to": 522000}, "text": " Let's see if CMake\u2026"}, {"offsets": {"from": 522000, "to": 523000}, "text": " There you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 523000, "to": 525000}, "text": " That's the dummy workspace."}, {"offsets": {"from": 525000, "to": 526000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 526000, "to": 528000}, "text": " So now we're just going to type CMake."}, {"offsets": {"from": 528000, "to": 529000}, "text": " Let's see what\u2026"}, {"offsets": {"from": 529000, "to": 530000}, "text": " Pause."}, {"offsets": {"from": 530000, "to": 532000}, "text": " It's the one fixed level."}, {"offsets": {"from": 532000, "to": 535000}, "text": " And this one down here is the output from Orphonic."}, {"offsets": {"from": 535000, "to": 538000}, "text": " So let's look at the Levelator one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 538000, "to": 543000}, "text": " Now, at first, I'm just going to zoom into the audio here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 543000, "to": 544000}, "text": " Okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 544000, "to": 546000}, "text": " And at first glance, it looked\u2026"}, {"offsets": {"from": 546000, "to": 548000}, "text": " Well, out here, it looked like\u2026"}, {"offsets": {"from": 548000, "to": 549000}, "text": " The\u2026"}, {"offsets": {"from": 549000, "to": 552000}, "text": " It looked like the Levelator program is more\u2026"}, {"offsets": {"from": 552000, "to": 557000}, "text": " Giving you a more dynamic response in there, so to speak."}, {"offsets": {"from": 557000, "to": 559000}, "text": " So, you know, at first glance, I thought\u2026"}, {"offsets": {"from": 559000, "to": 562000}, "text": " Because this is the first time I've compared these, by the way."}, {"offsets": {"from": 562000, "to": 565000}, "text": " And the Levelator, it looks like it gives a more dynamic response."}, {"offsets": {"from": 565000, "to": 571000}, "text": " And the Orphonic one down here makes it look like it's just, like,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 571000, "to": 573000}, "text": " clipped at top and bottom."}, {"offsets": {"from": 573000, "to": 576000}, "text": " But if you actually zoom in, look at this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 576000, "to": 579000}, "text": " Right at the start here, you can see that there's actually"}, {"offsets": {"from": 579000, "to": 583000}, "text": " more dynamic stuff in the Orphonic one down here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 583000, "to": 587000}, "text": " Look, it's still got some silent ones down here, but it's\u2026"}, {"offsets": {"from": 587000, "to": 592000}, "text": " But the Levelator one has sort of like\u2026"}, {"offsets": {"from": 592000, "to": 594000}, "text": " It's really normalized everything."}, {"offsets": {"from": 594000, "to": 595000}, "text": " Whereas\u2026"}, {"offsets": {"from": 595000, "to": 597000}, "text": " So the Orphonic one is giving you a more dynamic response."}, {"offsets": {"from": 597000, "to": 600000}, "text": " So let's play the Levelator first."}, {"offsets": {"from": 600000, "to": 601000}, "text": " Okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 601000, "to": 602000}, "text": " I've definitely muted those and those."}, {"offsets": {"from": 602000, "to": 605000}, "text": " This is the output from the Levelator."}, {"offsets": {"from": 605000, "to": 607000}, "text": " Hi, I'm chopped off."}, {"offsets"